    "productType": "",
    "tags": [],
    "descriptionHtml": "Made from 350GSM heavyweight fleece, this vintage hoodie combines warmth and durability without feeling bulky. Featuring a classic hood and a soft brushed interior, it offers all-day comfort with a retro streetwear vibe. Whether layered or worn solo, it’s perfect for custom printing and bulk orders. Match it with sweatpants #RK0005 to create a coordinated set.<h3>Features</h3><div>- Effects: Washed</div><div>- Fit: Oversized</div><div>- Neckline: Hooded</div><div>- Sleeve Style: Drop Shoulder</div><div>- Sleeve Length: Long Sleeve</div><div>- Season: Spring / Autumn / Winter</div><div>- Style: Basics / Casual / Street</div><h3>Care Instructions</h3><div>- Machine wash at 30°C (gentle cycle)</div><div>- Do not bleach</div><div>- Tumble dry low</div><div>- Iron at low temperature, avoid ironing on print</div><div>- Do not dry clean</div><h3>Fabric</h3><div>- Material: 53% polyester, 47% cotton</div><div>- Fabric Weight: 350 gsm (10.3 oz)</div><div>- Thickness: Extra Thick</div><div>- Breathability: Moderate</div><table id=\"size-guide\" style=\"width: 1024px;\"><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"font-weight: 400; border: 1px solid #e2e2e2; width: 150px; background: #F8F8F8;\"></td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: 400; border: 1px solid #e2e2e2; width: 150px; text-align: center; background: #F8F8F8;\" colspan=\"2\">S</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: 400; border: 1px solid #e2e2e2; width: 150px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\">M</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: 400; border: 1px solid #e2e2e2; width: 150px; text-align: center; background: #F8F8F8;\" colspan=\"2\">L</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: 400; border: 1px solid #e2e2e2; width: 150px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\">XL</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: 400; border: 1px solid #e2e2e2; width: 150px; text-align: center; background: #F8F8F8;\" colspan=\"2\">2XL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"font-weight: 400; border: 1px solid #e2e2e2; width: 150px; background: #F8F8F8;\"></td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: 400;